<div class="player_ringer_bg">
  <div class="player-speaker-list-section">
    <div class="page-width"> 
    <div class="player-speaker-list">
      <div class="item">
        <div class="player-speaker-info">
          <img src="{{'gps-distance.png' | asset_url}}" alt="GPS Distances icon" >
          <h3>GPS DISTANCES</h3>
          <p>Distances to the Front, Center, and Back, guiding you to select the ideal club for your shot. Click the action button to call out the distances.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="item">
        <div class="player-speaker-info">
          <img src="{{'dynamic-hazards.png' | asset_url}}" alt="Dynamic Hazards icon" >
          <h3>DYNAMIC HAZARDS</h3>
          <p>Identify hazards on each hole, arming you with all the information you need to play your best golf. </p>
        </div>
      </div>
       <div class="item">
        <div class="player-speaker-info">
          <img src="{{'driving-distance.png' | asset_url}}" alt="Driving Distance tracking icon" >
          <h3>DRIVING DISTANCE</h3>
          <p>Measure each drive with precision. Let your Player+ announce your longest drives, proving to your buddies that you can bomb it.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="item">
        <div class="player-speaker-info">
          <img src="{{'score-display.png' | asset_url}}" alt="Score Display icon" >
          <h3>SCORE DISPLAY</h3>
          <p>Experience a personalized scoreboard, keeping you updated on your standing throughout the round.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="item">
        <div class="player-speaker-info">
          <img src="{{'audible-feedback.png' | asset_url}}" alt="Audible Feedback speaker icon" >
          <h3>AUDIBLE FEEDBACK</h3>
          <p>Equipped with an audio assistant, hear audible callouts for Club Assist, Driving Distance, and Front, Center, Back Distances when enabled.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="item">
        <div class="player-speaker-info">
          <img src="{{'touch-screen-display.png' | asset_url}}" alt="Touch-Screen Display icon" >
          <h3>TOUCH-SCREEN DISPLAY</h3>
          <p>The Player+ makes it easy to swipe through the different screens with it’s all glass premium touch-screen display.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="item">
        <div class="player-speaker-info">
          <img src="{{'ipx7-waterproof.png' | asset_url}}" alt="IPX7 Waterproof rating icon" >
          <h3>IPX7 WATERPROOF</h3>
          <p>With an IPX7 waterproof rating, this speaker is primed to brave any storm — and even the occasional dive into the neighboring lake.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="item">
        <div class="player-speaker-info">
          <img src="{{'magnetic-strip.png' | asset_url}}" alt="Magnetic Strip mounting icon" >
          <h3>MAGNETIC STRIP</h3>
          <p>Designed with a high-powered magnet, this speaker securely attaches to any golf cart or MagHub.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .player-speaker-list-section{padding: 30px 0px;}
  .player-speaker-list{display: flex;flex-wrap: wrap;margin-left: -15px;margin-right: -15px;max-width: 1235px;margin: 0 auto;}
  .player-speaker-list .item{width: 25%;padding: 0px 20px;margin: 25px 0px;}
  .player-speaker-info {text-align: center;}
  .player-speaker-info img{box-shadow: 0px 2px 15px #fff;border-radius: 20px;margin-bottom: 20px;max-width: 225px;width: 100%;}
  .player-speaker-info h3{color: #fff;text-align: center;font-size: 17px;font-weight: 600;line-height: 19px;letter-spacing: 3px;}
  .player-speaker-info p{font-size: 14px;line-height: 16px;padding: 0;padding-top: 15px;}


  @media only screen and (min-width:220px) and (max-width:1080px) {
  .player-speaker-list .item{padding: 0px 15px;}
  }

  @media only screen and (min-width:220px) and (max-width:768px) {
  .player-speaker-list .item{width: 50%;padding: 0px 20px;}
  .player-speaker-info p{padding: 0;padding-top: 15px;}
  .player-speaker-list{max-width: 600px;margin: 0 auto;}
  }

   @media only screen and (min-width:220px) and (max-width:500px) {
  .player-speaker-list .item{width: 100%;padding: 0px;max-width: 275px;margin: 25px auto;}
   }
</style>


